{
  "info": {
    "name": "FinCore Organization KYC Workflow - Complete",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for Organization KYC Document Upload and Approval Workflow (May 2026):\n\n**New Features:**\n- Organization creation with inline KYC document uploads\n- Submit for Review workflow (PENDING → UNDER_REVIEW)\n- Admin Approve workflow (UNDER_REVIEW → ACTIVE)\n- Admin Reject workflow with document-level feedback\n- KYC document upload, download, delete operations\n- Resubmission workflow after rejection\n- Role-based access testing (Admin vs Business User)\n\n**Workflow Stages:**\n1. User creates organization (status: PENDING)\n2. User uploads KYC documents (3 required minimum)\n3. User submits for review (status: UNDER_REVIEW)\n4. Admin reviews and approves/rejects\n5. If rejected, user fixes issues and resubmits\n6. Final approval (status: ACTIVE)\n\nVersion: 3.0.0\nLast Updated: May 11, 2026",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{jwt_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwt_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "user_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "org_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "doc_id_1",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "doc_id_2",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "doc_id_3",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
